  (text "MOUNT. Harness support" (at 580.32 1625.50 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8ad1b339-0915-4b67-84a8-a4d480a542b4))
  (text "ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE; final layout/assembly review and bench qualification required. External mechanical DPST disconnect: STOP ROBOT BEFORE OFF. 27–33V intended battery operation,33.6V full; individual pack-source fuses required. J2 is original fused BATTERY-VOLTAGE motor passthrough to existing Flipsky controllers. No motor converter, brake clamp, external brake resistor, thermal contact or onboard CAN. Existing motor controllers retain their previous control connection and braking configuration. USB2 VBUS is sense only; local5V powers audio/UART/PWM through the CH334 hub. Hub port3 unused; no configuration EEPROM. OAK-D/microphone connect externally to Jetson USB3. Seven local shunts shortENtoGND=OFF; they do not isolate/discharge outputs. One PWM MCU requires firmware; signal disarm leaves servo5V powered. TwoXL330 chains share5V/data; twoXL430 chains share10.8V/data; threeMG90S share separate5V." (at 20.32 1647.40 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8c412f2b-116c-4d15-bcef-9e228613781d))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
